{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1896"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge technology/computing","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/technology__computing.g1.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",1061],["+"," The Compact Disc (CD) was also the first of three generations of optical disc: the DVD, agreed in 1995 and on sale from 1996, packed several gigabytes onto a disc of the same size with a red laser of shorter wavelength, and the Blu-ray Disc of 2006 used a blue-violet laser to reach 25 gigabytes per layer."],["=",110]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",971],["+"," Die Compact Disc (CD) war zugleich die erste von drei Generationen optischer Scheiben: Die DVD, 1995 vereinbart und ab 1996 im Handel, brachte mit einem roten Laser kürzerer Wellenlänge mehrere Gigabyte auf eine gleich große Scheibe, und die Blu-ray Disc von 2006 erreichte mit einem blauvioletten Laser 25 Gigabyte pro Schicht."],["=",94]]}]},
